before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
interface Reporter {
    String report();
}
class ConsoleReporter implements Reporter {
    @Override
    public String report() { return "ready"; }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Reporter reporter = new ConsoleReporter();
        System.out.println(reporter.report());
    }
}

```

